                <ab xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><lb n="1"/>ti-mo-ku-po-ro-se | o ti-mo-ke-re-te-o-se e-pe-se-ta-se | ki-li-ka-wi ←<lb n="2"/> to-i ka-si-ke-ne-to-i.</ab>
